# HTTP API (`ci_api`)

Routers: `system.py`, `projects.py`, `graph.py`, `chat.py` (wired in `main.py`). With `ci serve --ui`, routes mount at `/api/*`; standalone `ci serve` serves them at `/*`.

## Stability

Keep paths and `{"detail", "request_id"}` errors (`main.py` middleware + exception handlers). `X-Request-ID` on requests/responses.

## Auth

`CI_MODE=server` requires `CI_API_KEY` on all routes except `GET /health` (and `/api/health` when mounted). Header: `X-API-Key` or `Authorization: Bearer`.

## Performance

`GZipMiddleware` (min 2048 bytes) on graph JSON; SSE chat not gzipped.

## Chat

`POST /projects/{ref}/chat` returns SSE (`message`, `tool`, `citations`, `done`, `error`).

Catalog in `docs/ai/api-reference.md` — update when adding routes.
